  "prefLabel": "He-C 6344.08 Application Process For Payment Standards For CMHP Providers",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "He-C 6344.08 Application Process For Payment Standards For CMHP Providers.\n\n(a) CMHP’s shall be contracted for services through the DBH.\n\n(b) CMHP’s shall provide a copy of a “State of New Hampshire Alternate W-9 Form” to the DCYF certification specialist within 30 days of receipt.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at part heading for He-C 6344) #9311, eff 11-5-08; ss by #12206, eff 6-10-17 (from he-C 6344.09)",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/he-c6300.html"
